    "ko": "남의 남자"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Jung Eun-ae, whose life goal is to marry Jin-hong—an undeniably perfect boyfriend—and to build a family anyone would envy.\n\nGrowing weary of her boyfriend, who fails to fill her loneliness,\n\nshe finds herself drawn to her senior, Lee Jae-won,\n\nwho, despite his seemingly indifferent demeanor, is surprisingly considerate.\n\nDespite knowing that he is a married man,\n\nshe begins to feel an attraction toward him,\n\nand in order to have him,\n\nshe consciously—or perhaps unconsciously—starts to shatter her own moral beliefs one by one..."
  },
